        "0 - 6 Hard-Boiled Egg\010\010Hard-Boiled Egg (cap 6) \226\128\148 Fire Crystal \226\128\148 Bird Egg, Distilled Water\010\010Use Advanced support for at least the first level or two which should go quick.",
        "6 - 9 Pet Food Alpha\010\010Pet Food Alpha (cap 9) \226\128\148 Earth Crystal \226\128\148 Bird Egg, Hare Meat, Horo Flour, Distilled Water\010\010NPC results",
        "9 - 11 Sliced Sardine\010\010Sliced Sardine (cap 11) \226\128\148 Wind Crystal \226\128\148 Bastore Sardine\010\010This is where fishing comes in. You can skip straight to the next item on the list if you have Cod instead of Sardines",
      }},
      ["11-20"]={ rank="Recruit", url="https://horizonffxi.wiki/Category:Cooking/Recruit", blocks={
        "9 - 11 Sliced Sardine\010\010Sliced Sardine (cap 11) \226\128\148 Wind Crystal \226\128\148 Bastore Sardine\010\010This is where fishing comes in. You can skip straight to the next item on the list if you have Cod instead of Sardines",
        "11 - 13 Sliced Cod\010\010Sliced Cod (cap 13) \226\128\148 Wind Crystal \226\128\148 Tiger Cod\010\010NPC this as long as you want for decent gil",
        "13 - 19 Pet Food Beta\010\010Pet Food Beta (cap 19) \226\128\148 Earth Crystal \226\128\148 Karakul Meat, Apkallu Egg, Distilled Water, Horo Flour\010\010NPC results",
        "19 - 20 Selbina Butter\010\010Selbina Butter (cap 20) \226\128\148 Ice Crystal \226\128\148 Selbina Milk, Rock Salt\010\010Save this for the next bridge synth. Cost depends on price of Ices (Feb 17 patch nuked crystal price)",
        "20 - 22 Baked Popoto\010\010Baked Popoto (cap 22) \226\128\148 Fire Crystal \226\128\148 Popoto, Selbina Butter\010\010Use up the Selbina butter you made until you hit alteast 21. AH the leftover",
      }},
      ["21-30"]={ rank="Initiate", url="https://horizonffxi.wiki/Category:Cooking/Initiate", blocks={
        "20 - 22 Baked Popoto\010\010Baked Popoto (cap 22) \226\128\148 Fire Crystal \226\128\148 Popoto, Selbina Butter\010\010Use up the Selbina butter you made until you hit alteast 21. AH the leftover",
        "22 - 29 Insect Ball\010\010Insect Ball (cap 29) \226\128\148 Earth Crystal \226\128\148 Millioncorn, Little Worm, Distilled Water\010\010Advanced Support. This is a money maker sell it all on AH. It moves extremely fast since 75% of Horizon is fishing for Moats it seems.",
        "29 - 34 Black Bread\010\010Black Bread (cap 34) \226\128\148 Fire Crystal \226\128\148 Rye Flour, Rock Salt, Distilled Water\010\010Just NPC this for about break even.",
