        "34 - 39 Pet Food Delta\010\010Pet Food Delta (cap 39) \226\128\148 Earth Crystal \226\128\148 Bird Egg, Land Crab Meat, Rye Flour, Distilled Water\010\010NPC for a profit. At this point you might have actually made a total profit if you sold all your Insect Balls",
        "39 - 46 Pickled Herring\010\010Pickled Herring (cap 46) \226\128\148 Ice Crystal \226\128\148 Nosteau Herring, Dried Marjoram, Rock Salt\010\010Adv Support till 41. If you have been leveling fishing you can start the Herring at 29 or 25+4 from gear.\010NPC results",
      }},
      ["41-50"]={ rank="Apprentice", url="https://horizonffxi.wiki/Category:Cooking/Apprentice", blocks={
        "39 - 46 Pickled Herring\010\010Pickled Herring (cap 46) \226\128\148 Ice Crystal \226\128\148 Nosteau Herring, Dried Marjoram, Rock Salt\010\010Adv Support till 41. If you have been leveling fishing you can start the Herring at 29 or 25+4 from gear.\010NPC results",
        "46 - 50 Apple Pie\010\010Apple Pie (cap 48) \226\128\148 Fire Crystal \226\128\148 Lizard Egg, Faerie Apple, Pie Dough, Maple Sugar, Cinnamon\010\010Switching the egg increases the cap of the synth.\010These will sell eventually but you may just want to NPC them depending how fast you want to move onto the next synth.\010Can be skipped if you want to 6 gap the Crayfish Balls.\010You WILL lose a LOT of money on these.",
